{"seq":3,"slug":"iterative-retrieval","title":"迭代检索与终止","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/agentic-rag/iteration/iterative-retrieval","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"迭代检索与终止\">迭代检索与终止</h1><p>一个智能体 RAG 系统上线第一周最常见的事故，不是答错，而是&quot;停不下来&quot;——某个问题进了回路，模型每查一轮都觉得&quot;再查一次说不定更全&quot;，于是查了十几跳，延迟飙到几十秒，token 账单触目惊心，最后给出的答案还不如查三跳时好。多跳给了系统不断检索的能力，反思给了它判断质量的能力，但这两样合在一起，恰恰制造了一个新问题：什么时候该收手？这一篇专讲迭代回路的控制——尤其是那个最容易翻车、却最常被忽视的终止条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>迭代检索回路由三个部分构成：一个<strong>继续/停止的判断</strong>、一组<strong>终止条件</strong>、一个<strong>兜底的硬上限</strong>。前两者决定&quot;正常情况下何时停&quot;，最后一个防止前两者失灵时无限打转。下图是带完整终止控制的回路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[进入回路 iter=0] --&gt; RET[检索一轮]&#10;    RET --&gt; GRADE[反思评分]&#10;    GRADE --&gt; C1{信息足够&lt;br/&gt;回答了吗}&#10;    C1 --&gt;|是| ANS[作答并退出]&#10;    C1 --&gt;|否| C2{本轮有进展吗&lt;br/&gt;新信息增益&gt;阈值}&#10;    C2 --&gt;|无进展| STOP[停止·按现有信息作答&lt;br/&gt;或如实说查不到]&#10;    C2 --&gt;|有进展| C3{iter &lt; 上限}&#10;    C3 --&gt;|否,触顶| STOP&#10;    C3 --&gt;|是| INC[iter+1] --&gt; RET\">flowchart TD\n    START[进入回路 iter=0] --&gt; RET[检索一轮]\n    RET --&gt; GRADE[反思评分]\n    GRADE --&gt; C1{信息足够&lt;br/&gt;回答了吗}\n    C1 --&gt;|是| ANS[作答并退出]\n    C1 --&gt;|否| C2{本轮有进展吗&lt;br/&gt;新信息增益&gt;阈值}\n    C2 --&gt;|无进展| STOP[停止·按现有信息作答&lt;br/&gt;或如实说查不到]\n    C2 --&gt;|有进展| C3{iter &lt; 上限}\n    C3 --&gt;|否,触顶| STOP\n    C3 --&gt;|是| INC[iter+1] --&gt; RET</pre><p>这张图的要害是有<strong>三道独立的出口</strong>：信息够了（理想出口）、没进展了（避免空转）、触达硬上限（兜底)。只有一道出口的回路是脆弱的——只看&quot;信息够没够&quot;，一旦模型的判断偏乐观，就永远觉得不够，于是不停。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>控制部件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>缺了会怎样</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>充分性判断</td>\n<td>信息够了就停</td>\n<td>永不主动停</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进展判断</td>\n<td>连续无新信息就停</td>\n<td>在原地空转重复检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬上限</td>\n<td>兜底强制停</td>\n<td>极端情况下无限循环</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"终止条件-三种信号-缺一不可\">终止条件：三种信号，缺一不可</h2><p>可靠的终止不能只靠一种信号，要把几种叠起来，任一触发就停。</p>\n<p><strong>充分性信号</strong>是最理想的终止——模型判断&quot;已经有足够信息回答原问题了&quot;。它通常复用<a href=\"reflection-grading\">反思与文档评分</a>的能力：让模型评估当前累积的证据能否支撑一个完整答案。问题是它依赖模型的自我判断，而模型对&quot;够不够&quot;的判断系统性偏乐观或偏保守，单靠它不稳。</p>\n<p><strong>进展信号</strong>是防空转的关键。如果连续两轮检索带回的都是已经见过的、或信息增益极小的内容，说明继续查也是徒劳，该停。形式化地，设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 轮新增的有效信息量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 持续若干轮就终止。这条信号能抓住&quot;模型陷在某个查不到的方向上反复试&quot;的情况，是充分性信号抓不到的。</p>\n<p><strong>硬上限</strong>是工程兜底——直接限制最大迭代轮数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。社区教程与框架示例常把多跳回路上限设在约 3 跳（如 LlamaIndex 的 ReActAgent 教程示例即以 cap iterations at 3 为起点），把它当作经验起点而非硬标准更准确：多数真实问题三跳内能答，超过三跳还没答出来的，通常是问题本身知识库答不了，再查也是浪费。另一端，Deep Research 类长研究任务的回路可达数十轮迭代——上限该多大，最终由任务形态决定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>终止信号</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>主要防范</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>充分性</td>\n<td>模型判断信息已足够</td>\n<td>过度检索</td>\n<td>中（依赖自判）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进展（信息增益）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span> 持续若干轮</td>\n<td>原地空转</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬上限</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">iter \\geq N_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7955em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无限循环</td>\n<td>最高（兜底）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"上限该设几-一个成本与质量的权衡\">上限该设几：一个成本与质量的权衡</h2><p>硬上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不是越大越好。它直接卡住了成本上界，也卡住了能力上界，得在两者间权衡。设每轮边际成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，每多一轮带来的边际准确率提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，理性的上限应停在边际收益不再值得边际成本的那一点：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta a_i \\cdot V &lt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是答对一题的价值。</p>\n<p>实务里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是递减的——第一跳到第二跳提升明显，第三跳之后往往边际趋零。这就解释了为什么 3 跳是个常见的甜点：它落在边际收益曲线开始拍平的位置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[设定上限 Nmax] --&gt; B[低 Nmax: 省钱&lt;br/&gt;但难题答不全]&#10;    A --&gt; C[高 Nmax: 能力强&lt;br/&gt;但成本/延迟失控]&#10;    A --&gt; D[甜点 ~3 跳:&lt;br/&gt;边际收益开始拍平]&#10;    D --&gt; E[按问题难度动态调:&lt;br/&gt;路由判难,难题给更高上限]\">graph TD\n    A[设定上限 Nmax] --&gt; B[低 Nmax: 省钱&lt;br/&gt;但难题答不全]\n    A --&gt; C[高 Nmax: 能力强&lt;br/&gt;但成本/延迟失控]\n    A --&gt; D[甜点 ~3 跳:&lt;br/&gt;边际收益开始拍平]\n    D --&gt; E[按问题难度动态调:&lt;br/&gt;路由判难,难题给更高上限]</pre><p>更进一步，上限可以<strong>按问题难度动态设</strong>：<a href=\"../retrieval-as-tool/query-routing\">查询路由</a>既然已经判过难度，就让简单问题用低上限、难题用高上限，而不是一刀切。这把终止控制和路由打通，是 2026 年成熟系统的常见做法。这笔账的完整核算在<a href=\"../practice/latency-cost-tradeoffs\">延迟与成本</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"停下来之后-诚实比硬答更重要\">停下来之后：诚实比硬答更重要</h2><p>终止控制有个常被忽略的尾巴：触达上限却还没答出来时，系统该说什么？最糟的做法是硬憋一个答案——这等于退回到朴素 RAG&quot;没有也编&quot;的老路，且因为绕了好几跳，编出来的还更像模像样、更难被发现。</p>\n<p>正确的收尾是分情况：如果累积的证据足以给出<strong>部分答案</strong>，就明确标注&quot;基于现有资料，我只能确定 X，关于 Y 未找到依据&quot;；如果连部分答案都撑不起，就如实回答&quot;知识库中未找到相关信息&quot;，并可以把&quot;查不到&quot;本身作为一个有用的信号（也许该补语料、也许该转人工）。这种&quot;宁可承认查不到，不可自信编造&quot;的收尾纪律，恰恰是反思机制（IsSup 忠实度判断）要保障的，也是<a href=\"../practice/agentic-rag-evaluation\">评测</a>里要专门测的一项——一个好的智能体 RAG，在没答案时说&quot;不知道&quot;的能力，和有答案时答对的能力同样重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多跳与反思合在一起会催生&quot;停不下来&quot;的新问题，迭代回路必须有显式终止控制：充分性判断、进展判断、硬上限三道独立出口，缺一不可。</li>\n<li>充分性信号最理想但依赖模型自判（偏乐观/保守）；进展信号（信息增益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_i &lt; \\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>）防原地空转；硬上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是兜底，多跳问答的常见经验起点约 3 跳，Deep Research 类长任务可达数十轮。</li>\n<li>上限是成本与能力的权衡：边际准确率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 递减使 3 跳成为常见甜点，且应按路由判定的难度动态设上限而非一刀切。</li>\n<li>触顶未答出时要诚实——给部分答案并标注边界，或如实说&quot;查不到&quot;，绝不硬编；这份纪律由忠实度反思保障，也是评测的重点项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：终止依赖的质量判断见 <a href=\"reflection-grading\">反思与文档评分</a>；回路里逐跳推进见 <a href=\"multi-hop-retrieval\">多跳检索</a>；按难度设上限的路由见 <a href=\"../retrieval-as-tool/query-routing\">查询路由</a>。</li>\n<li>成本核算见 <a href=\"../practice/latency-cost-tradeoffs\">延迟与成本</a>，&quot;查不到&quot;能力的评测见 <a href=\"../practice/agentic-rag-evaluation\">评测</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库：回路失败时的恢复策略见 <a href=\"../../llm-agent-planning/adaptation/replanning-recovery\">重规划与恢复</a>（78 号 hub）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"迭代检索与终止","id":"迭代检索与终止"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"终止条件：三种信号，缺一不可","id":"终止条件-三种信号-缺一不可"},{"level":2,"text":"上限该设几：一个成本与质量的权衡","id":"上限该设几-一个成本与质量的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"停下来之后：诚实比硬答更重要","id":"停下来之后-诚实比硬答更重要"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"反思与文档评分 (CRAG/Self-RAG)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/agentic-rag/iteration/reflection-grading"},"next":{"title":"评测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/agentic-rag/practice/agentic-rag-evaluation"}}